#        ___
#     __/   \__        RYHOX WORKS · things the machine keeps to itself
#    /  \___/  \
#    \__/   \__/       Everything below is made, fetched or dropped here by
#       \___/          accident. None of it belongs in the history.
#

# ── the engine room ─────────────────────────────── (npm fills it back up)
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── what Next.js builds on its own ─────────────── (sawdust off the lathe)
.next/
out/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.vercel/

# ── secrets ────────────────────────────────────── (the kettle stays in the kitchen)
.env*.local
.env

# ── raw materials ──────────────────────────────── (huge, and only mine to hand out)
# the Sketchfab originals stay local; the squeezed copies in public/models are committed
assets/source/*.glb
assets/source/*.zip

# ── screenshots ────────────────────────────────── (every "does this look right?")
# the headless QA runs and the ones taken by hand, in every language the OS speaks
qa-shots/
screenshots/
Screenshot*.png
Screen Shot*.png
Schermata*.png
Bildschirmfoto*.png
Capture d’écran*.png
*.screenshot.png

# ── benchmarks and traces ──────────────────────── (how fast the cogs turned, last Tuesday)
bench-results/
*.cpuprofile
*.heapsnapshot
trace-*.json

# ── the machine's own crumbs ───────────────────── (it sheds, like any workshop)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

#    that's everything. the cogs are tidy. ⚙
